### Create stock
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "sku": "{{sku1}}",
  "on_hand": 1
}

### Create stock 2
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "sku": "{{sku2}}",
  "on_hand": 10
}


### Update stock qty
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

{
  "sku": "{{sku1}}",
  "on_hand": 10
}

### Delete stock record
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/stock/{{sku1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Get Stock by sku
GET http://localhost:8080/stock/{{sku1}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}

### Get Stocks with pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/stock?limit=5&offset=2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}

### Get Stocks with pagination default values limit=50&offset=0
GET http://localhost:8080/stock
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{publicToken}}

### Get Active Reservation Items by SKU (admin) with pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/stock/{{sku1}}/reservation-items?limit=10&offset=0
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
